  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d29874e3b4e59e549ab8ca779e34be5a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Earth_1-Reaction to hole 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: T.I.I.G.E.R
  paragraphs:
  - "Hmph. Like I said, that was the easiest hole of them all. Why don\u2019t we
    try something a little more difficult\u2026"
  - 'I suppose to be fair, I must provide the same technology the Caddi leveraged
    while golfing. '
  - "Behold, the Maximally Extended Relativistic Space Time Analysis Overlay! The
    required qubit data has been uploaded to your Spacecraft\u2019s OS."
  - 'Use the overlay to analyse the gravitational influence of objects, as well as
    reveal hidden interdimensional artefacts. '
  - The Caddi used to leave small spacetime-tearing stars as an opportunity for competitors
    to net themselves extra points. Intercepting the pocket dimension will collect
    the artefact.
  - Be careful though, if your shot is incomplete, you will lose it.
